 "statement": "Fixed native public-target interface controls: six distinct actual Curve25519 raw parameters compile to1059 variables/1089 quadratic equations/3323 terms; all1059 single-variable mutations and listed malformed/target/duplicate/cap controls reject. Eighteen actual signed raw labels are recovered and verified by standard Fp2 BSGS with14600 baby entries. Equal/inverse/identity-intermediate actual controls replay signed indexed rows. The fixed Fp101/A95 fixture has104 curve points/13 cofactor images,44 retained signed leaves and two excluded identity raw columns. All24024 distinct-raw-pair/target canonical assignments agree with native addition;1848 accept, including144 equal-image and144 inverse-image pairs. Snapshot43 inputs and ten compiled-in source hashes match; release tests2/fmt/strict Clippy pass. These are producer-local finite software controls, not compiler/formal group/yield/solver/exponent or signed execution evidence."
